Header: BRIDE — Wedding Day Quick Checklist
24 hrs before: Confirm florist & rings; pack emergency kit
Morning: Hair 8:00 AM; Makeup 9:00 AM; Light breakfast
At ceremony: Walk left of officiant; bouquet handoff to MOH
Vendor handoff: Photographer list; reception contact: Jake 555-0333

groom.png
Header: GROOM — Wedding Day Quick Checklist
24 hrs before: Confirm suit & shoes; rings with best man
Morning: Eat protein; check vows & vows folder
At ceremony: Stand right of officiant; place ring on pillow
Vendor handoff: Transport for decorations; pick up tux alterations

moh.png
Header: MAID OF HONOR — Quick Checklist
24 hrs before: Confirm bridesmaids' arrival times
Morning: Assist bride w/dress & accessories
At ceremony: Hold bouquet; gather veil
Vendor handoff: Keep emergency kit; deliver gifts

bm.png
Header: BEST MAN — Quick Checklist
24 hrs before: Keep rings safe; confirm transport
Morning: Help groom w/dress; collect vows
At ceremony: Hold rings; sign marriage license witness
Vendor handoff: Collect groom's personal items

parents.png
Header: PARENTS — Quick Checklist
24 hrs before: Confirm seating & transport
Morning: Help with family photos list
At ceremony: Walk down aisle; guest seating cue
Vendor handoff: Coordinate family table at reception

vendors.png
Header: VENDORS — Quick Checklist
24 hrs before: Confirm arrival windows & load-in plan
Morning: Final site walkthrough; confirm power/water access
At ceremony: Vendor contact person: ______
Vendor handoff: Clean-up & pick-up schedule

